    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77804" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρα-βλητέος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be compared</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span> to
			one, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cim.</u>
				3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραβλητέον</span>, <i>one must
			compare</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. καὶ συγκριτέον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Muson.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					8p.37H.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>one must set before, offer</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				2.35
			</span></i>; <i>one must throw before</i>, [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοῒ] τροφήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					17.19.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>one must divide</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nicom.
				<u>Ar.</u>
				2.27
			</span></i>, Theo Sm.<i><span class="en">
				p.119
			</span></i> H.</div>
